"question-b6e9a199-9ae7-5749-8e50-9bec321630b9" :question/id #uuid "b6e9a199-9ae7-5749-8e50-9bec321630b9" :question/math-academy-id "q-67642" :question/problem "![](images/d6/d67e2cb1a53f6063cf798294cbf077729bb3cf3621ba242325129b81dfe6c791.png)\n\nWhat is the measure of the line segment $\\overset{―}{AB}$ shown above?" :question/worked-solution "Note that the length of a side of one cell is \n\n$$\n\\frac{6\\,\\text{m}}{3}=2\\,\\text{m}.\n$$\n\nThe line segment has a length of $6$ cells, hence the total measure is \n\n$$\nAB=6\\cdot 2\\,\\text{m}=12\\,\\text{m}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4410f461-24a9-548a-aea8-764d78323df6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4410f461-24a9-548a-aea8-764d78323df6" :answer-field/id #uuid "4410f461-24a9-548a-aea8-764d78323df6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c2acc43f-7be9-5978-9020-22741ba76b56" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c2acc43f-7be9-5978-9020-22741ba76b56" "answer-731f8a04-11fc-5918-bc53-b85904d9ca9d" "answer-b1fae5a6-fd23-57ad-a08f-80aaafecd37b" "answer-47db7bb3-bbf7-56a0-8853-3874d8540483" "answer-36303113-ba12-57e0-aa9a-971ea6bf5256"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c2acc43f-7be9-5978-9020-22741ba76b56" :answer/id #uuid "c2acc43f-7be9-5978-9020-22741ba76b56" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12\\,\\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-731f8a04-11fc-5918-bc53-b85904d9ca9d" :answer/id #uuid "731f8a04-11fc-5918-bc53-b85904d9ca9d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18\\,\\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b1fae5a6-fd23-57ad-a08f-80aaafecd37b" :answer/id #uuid "b1fae5a6-fd23-57ad-a08f-80aaafecd37b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36\\,\\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-47db7bb3-bbf7-56a0-8853-3874d8540483" :answer/id #uuid "47db7bb3-bbf7-56a0-8853-3874d854